# vLLM v0.26.0 patch 14/18 (apply after the four DeepSeek-V4 patches above it).
#
# DeepSeek-V4 on ROCm: deterministic indexer top-k with 4-bit radix rounds.
#
# Finds the same cutoff key as patch 03 most-significant-bit first, 4 bits per
# round, with rows of <= 4096 columns held in registers. The final pass is
# unchanged, so the output is bitwise the same (393-case gate on MI355X); it is
# a decode latency change (53.6 us/call at B=4 before).
#
# Upstream: not yet proposed (same DeepSeek-V4 ROCm RFC as patch 02).
#
# Source commits:
#   [ROCm][DSv4][BI] Deterministic indexer top-k: 4-bit radix rounds, row in registers
#
